/extras/Meteors_cropped.gif?t=1742588066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/Separation_up.png?t=1742588066\" />Timing is everything! Know when to attack, when to hold your cards, and when to expand your action points. Plan your turns carefully to balance risk and reward, ensuring your team grows stronger without being overwhelmed by enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a wide range of enemies, each with unique strategies! Powerful dragons, relentless orc hordes, cunning demons, impenetrable golems, and undead legions will test your tactics. Choose your team wisely and adapt to every challenge.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/Separation.png?t=1742588066\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Gaister Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/header.jpg?t=1742588066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Heroes of Magic and Steel","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 4GB / AMD Radeon RX 550 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB